{"Gaussian over the whole line (exact!)"->(*SqB[*)Sqrt[\[Pi]](*]SqB*),"but on a finite interval"->-(*FB[*)((1)(*,*)/(*,*)(2))(*]FB*) ((*SqB[*)Sqrt[\[Pi]](*]SqB*)) (-1+Erfc[1]),"...as a number"->0.746824`,"no elementary form at all"->1.380427`}

